1
00:03:35,555 --> 00:03:41,555
Sex. Clothes. Popularity. Is there a problem here?

2
00:07:11,111 --> 00:07:17,111
Clueless is a comedy, romance film directed by Amy Heckerling.

3
00:10:46,666 --> 00:10:52,666
Shallow, rich and socially successful Cher is at the top of
her Beverly Hills high school's pecking scale.

4
00:14:22,222 --> 00:14:28,222
Seeing herself as a matchmaker, Cher first coaxes
two teachers into dating each other.

5
00:17:57,777 --> 00:18:03,777
Emboldened by her success, she decides to give
hopelessly klutzy new student Tai a makeover.

6
00:21:33,333 --> 00:21:39,333
When Tai becomes more popular than she is, Cher realizes that her disapproving
ex-stepbrother was right about how misguided she was -- and falls for him.

7
00:25:08,888 --> 00:25:14,888
Cher, played by Alicia Silverstone.

8
00:28:44,444 --> 00:28:50,444
Dionne, played by Stacey Dash.

9
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:26,000
Tai, played by Brittany Murphy.

10
00:35:55,555 --> 00:36:01,555
Josh, played by Paul Rudd.

11
00:39:31,111 --> 00:39:37,111
Murray, played by Donald Faison.

12
00:43:06,666 --> 00:43:12,666
Amber, played by Elisa Donovan.

13
00:46:42,222 --> 00:46:48,222
Clueless is a 1995 American coming-of-age teen comedy film
written and directed by Amy Heckerling.

14
00:50:17,777 --> 00:50:23,777
It stars Alicia Silverstone, and was produced by
Scott Rudin and Robert Lawrence.

15
00:53:53,333 --> 00:53:59,333
The film is a loose adaptation of Jane Austen's 1815 novel Emma.

16
00:57:28,888 --> 00:57:34,888
The plot centers on a beautiful, popular, wealthy high
school student who wants to do "good deeds".

17
01:01:04,444 --> 01:01:10,444
She befriends a newcomer and decides to give her a makeover while playing
matchmaker for her teachers and examining her own existence.

18
01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:46,000
Clueless was filmed in Southern California over a 40-day schedule.

19
01:08:15,555 --> 01:08:21,555
Heckerling studied Beverly Hills High School students to understand how teenagers in
the 1990s talked and learned some appropriate slang terms from them.

20
01:11:51,111 --> 01:11:57,111
Clueless was released by Paramount Pictures on July 19, 1995.

21
01:15:26,666 --> 01:15:32,666
The film grossed $88 million worldwide, and was further
successful in the home video market.

22
01:19:02,222 --> 01:19:08,222
It received positive reviews from critics and is considered
to be one of the best teen films of all time.

23
01:22:37,777 --> 01:22:43,777
Clueless has developed a cult following and has a continuing legacy.

24
01:26:13,333 --> 01:26:19,333
The film was followed by a spin-off television sitcom and series of books.

25
01:29:48,888 --> 01:29:54,888
The film explores themes of puberty, high school, based on
novel or book, make a match, spoiled child.

26
01:33:24,444 --> 01:33:30,444
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
